{"3708210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Xenolocus", "steam_appid": 3708210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into darkness and madness with this VR FPS horror featuring procedural levels. Expect brutal combat, terrifying enemies, and mysterious missions in a world where every step could be your last. Fight monsters, upgrade your skills, and uncover the secrets of a corporation conducting deadly experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide arsenal of weapons - from pistols and rifles to flamethrowers and turrets. Every battle demands precision and quick reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills: speed up firing, increase damage, activate sniper mode, and customize weapons to your needs. Upgrades provide real combat advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprises in Every Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is unique. Procedural generation makes every game truly different. Destroy enemy forces, gather resources, rescue survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, claustrophobic spaces, repulsive monsters, and sudden attacks. Constant fear and tension every minute of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies You Can’t Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xenos, mutants, and other nightmare creatures. Each enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, face final battles with massive bosses that test your skill and endurance.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into darkness and madness with this VR FPS horror featuring procedural levels. Expect brutal combat, terrifying enemies, and mysterious missions in a world where every step could be your last. Fight monsters, upgrade your skills, and uncover the secrets of a corporation conducting deadly experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide arsenal of weapons - from pistols and rifles to flamethrowers and turrets. Every battle demands precision and quick reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills: speed up firing, increase damage, activate sniper mode, and customize weapons to your needs. Upgrades provide real combat advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprises in Every Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is unique. Procedural generation makes every game truly different. Destroy enemy forces, gather resources, rescue survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, claustrophobic spaces, repulsive monsters, and sudden attacks. Constant fear and tension every minute of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies You Can’t Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xenos, mutants, and other nightmare creatures. Each enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, face final battles with massive bosses that test your skill and endurance.</p>", "short_description": "VR FPS horror with procedural levels. Shoot xenos, complete missions, upgrade.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/ec9f4ec99945814b7d1701bdc1326583415050ac/header.jpg?t=1785329405", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/b5c2e5aceeb74ff744b78bab5dc277a97b45e383/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785329405", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/b5c2e5aceeb74ff744b78bab5dc277a97b45e383/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785329405", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Requires VR headset (Quest 2 / PICO 4 / HTC Vive)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenXR supported. Quest Link / Air Link compatible.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3070 / AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Requires VR headset (Quest 3 / Valve Index / PICO 4)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenXR supported. Quest Link / Air Link compatible.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MAKSIMOV VALERII"], "publishers": ["MAKSIMOV VALERII"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 54, "description": "VR Only"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id"